        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Ndlela kaSompisi, Shaka kaSenzangakhona, Dingane\n- Roles: Zulu general, Zulu king, monarch\n- Organizations: Zulu Kingdom\n\nFacts:\n- Shaka kaSenzangakhona, also known as Shaka Zulu, lived from about 1787 to 22 September 1828.\n- Shaka kaSenzangakhona was one of the most influential monarchs of the Zulu Kingdom.\n- Ndlela kaSompisi died in February 1840.\n- Ndlela kaSompisi was a key general to Zulu kings Shaka and Dingane.",
